[Poke:Infinite Lives]
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$9065(#N$9065),#N$00</code>
</div>

Removes the instruction which would otherwise decrease #R$5EA1.

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$9062(#N$9062)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGa,(#R$5EA1(#N$5EA1))</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$9065(#N$9065)</td>
      <td class="instruction">DEC #REGa</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$9066(#N$9066)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD (#R$5EA1(#N$5EA1)),#REGa</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

To:

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$9062(#N$9062)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGa,(#R$5EA1(#N$5EA1))</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$9065(#N$9065)</td>
      <td class="instruction">NOP</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$9066(#N$9066)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD (#R$5EA1(#N$5EA1)),#REGa</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

[Poke:255 Lives]
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$A854(#N$A855),#N$FF</code>
</div>
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$A86C(#N$A86D),#N$FF</code>
</div>

This changes the starting lives from #N$04 (1UP) and #N$05 (2UP) to
#N$FF. The 2UP value is one higher than 1UP because of how
#R$A880 copies the inactive player.

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$A854(#N$A854)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGa,#N$04</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$A856(#N$A856)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD (#R$5EA1(#N$5EA1)),#REGa</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$A86C(#N$A86C)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGa,#N$05</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$A86E(#N$A86E)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD (#R$5EA5(#N$5EA5)),#REGa</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

To:

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$A854(#N$A854)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGa,#N$FF</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$A856(#N$A856)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD (#R$5EA1(#N$5EA1)),#REGa</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$A86C(#N$A86C)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGa,#N$FF</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$A86E(#N$A86E)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD (#R$5EA5(#N$5EA5)),#REGa</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

[Poke:Infinite Fuel]
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$8DAC(#N$8DAC),#N$00</code>
</div>
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$8DAC(#N$8DAD),#N$00</code>
</div>

Removes the subtract which would otherwise take the spent fuel off
#R$608E.

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$8DA4(#N$8DA4)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGhl,(#R$608E(#N$608E))</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$8DAC(#N$8DAC)</td>
      <td class="instruction">SBC #REGhl,#REGbc</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

To:

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$8DA4(#N$8DA4)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGhl,(#R$608E(#N$608E))</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$8DAC(#N$8DAC)</td>
      <td class="instruction">NOP</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$8DAC(#N$8DAD)</td>
      <td class="instruction">NOP</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

[Poke:Immunity]
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$B2D0(#N$B2D0),#N$C3</code>
</div>
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$B2D5(#N$B2D5),#N$A7</code>
</div>

#R$B2D0 is the height test used before an actor explodes on
Jetman.

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$B2D0(#N$B2D0)</td>
      <td class="instruction">JP P,#R$B2D5(#N$B2D5)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$B2D3(#N$B2D3)</td>
      <td class="instruction">NEG</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$B2D5(#N$B2D5)</td>
      <td class="instruction">CP #REGe</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$B2D6(#N$B2D6)</td>
      <td class="instruction">RET</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

To:

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$B2D0(#N$B2D0)</td>
      <td class="instruction">JP #R$B2D5(#N$B2D5)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$B2D5(#N$B2D5)</td>
      <td class="instruction">AND #REGa</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$B2D6(#N$B2D6)</td>
      <td class="instruction">RET</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

The first poke always jumps to #R$B2D5. The second clears carry, so
the following <code>RET</code> never comes back with carry set.

[Poke:Infinite Time]
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$ABDD(#N$ABDD),#N$18</code>
</div>

Turns the type check into an unconditional skip, so *#REGix+#N$17
is never decreased and #R$B16F is never called from here.

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$ABD8(#N$ABD8)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGa,(#R$6078(#N$6078))</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$ABDB(#N$ABDB)</td>
      <td class="instruction">CP #N$81</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$ABDD(#N$ABDD)</td>
      <td class="instruction">JR Z,#R$ABE5(#N$ABE5)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$ABDF(#N$ABDF)</td>
      <td class="instruction">DEC (#REGix+#N$17)</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

To:

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$ABD8(#N$ABD8)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGa,(#R$6078(#N$6078))</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$ABDB(#N$ABDB)</td>
      <td class="instruction">CP #N$81</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$ABDD(#N$ABDD)</td>
      <td class="instruction">JR #R$ABE5(#N$ABE5)</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

[Poke:No Enemies]
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$946F(#N$946F),#N$C9</code>
</div>

Turns the delay check in #R$9466 into an immediate return, so a
new alien is never copied into a free slot.

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$946B(#N$946B)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGa,(#R$5E67(#N$5E67))</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$946E(#N$946E)</td>
      <td class="instruction">AND #REGa</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$946F(#N$946F)</td>
      <td class="instruction">RET NZ</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

To:

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$946B(#N$946B)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGa,(#R$5E67(#N$5E67))</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$946E(#N$946E)</td>
      <td class="instruction">AND #REGa</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$946F(#N$946F)</td>
      <td class="instruction">RET</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

[Poke:Destroy Missile With One Shot]
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$AF6A(#N$AF6A),#N$18</code>
</div>

Treats the missile as destroyed as soon as one hit is taken off
*#REGix+#N$16.

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$AF67(#N$AF67)</td>
      <td class="instruction">DEC (#REGix+#N$16)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$AF6A(#N$AF6A)</td>
      <td class="instruction">JR Z,#R$AFB1(#N$AFB1)</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

To:

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$AF67(#N$AF67)</td>
      <td class="instruction">DEC (#REGix+#N$16)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$AF6A(#N$AF6A)</td>
      <td class="instruction">JR #R$AFB1(#N$AFB1)</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
